 =artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Amsterdam\, Netherlands. Present at the institute 4 days a week. O
 pen to scholars from the Netherlands and abroad\; no applications from res
 earchers affiliated with institutions in Russia or Belarus.
